{
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Chapter 1: Before America, There Was France",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s02b01",
     "shot": "c1_invade",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1858, France invaded Vietnam.",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:invaded",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b02",
     "shot": "colony",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Over the following decades, it expanded its control over the region.",
     "date": 1858,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b03",
     "shot": "colony",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "By 1887, France had established French Indochina, a colonial federation that included Vietnam, Laos, and Cambodia.",
     "date": 1887,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:Laos,",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:Cambodia.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b04",
     "shot": "rubber",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And colonial rule was brutal.",
     "date": 1900,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b05",
     "shot": "rubber",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "French authorities took control of valuable farmland, expanded rice and rubber plantations,",
     "date": 1900,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b06",
     "shot": "rubber",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "imposed taxes on ordinary people, and maintained monopolies over products such as salt, alcohol, and opium.",
     "date": 1900,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:salt,",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:alcohol,",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:opium.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b07",
     "shot": "rubber",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The economy grew, but much of the wealth flowed to colonial businesses and officials.",
     "date": 1900,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "coins",
       "w:wealth",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b08",
     "shot": "rice_tax",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Vietnamese farmers were forced to work land they didn't own,",
     "date": 1900,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b09",
     "shot": "rice_tax",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "pay taxes to a government they didn't choose,",
     "date": 1900,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:taxes",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b10",
     "shot": "rice_tax",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "and live under a system designed primarily to benefit France.",
     "date": 1900,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b11",
     "shot": "exploited",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In other words, Vietnam wasn't simply being governed by a foreign power.",
     "date": 1900,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b12",
     "shot": "exploited",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "It was being exploited by one.",
     "date": 1900,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:exploited",
       0.7
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b13",
     "shot": "ho_reveal",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And eventually, someone decided to fight back.",
     "date": 1900,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b14",
     "shot": "ho_reveal",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "His name was Ho Chi Minh.",
     "date": 1900,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "riser",
       0,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Ho",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b15",
     "shot": "travels",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Born in 1890, Ho left Vietnam in 1911 and spent years living abroad.",
     "date": 1890,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b16",
     "shot": "travels",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "He traveled through countries including France, Britain, the Soviet Union, and China.",
     "date": 1911,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:France,",
       0.3
      ],
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:Britain,",
       0.3
      ],
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:Soviet",
       0.3
      ],
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:China.",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b17",
     "shot": "travels",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "During those years, he studied revolutionary movements and became a committed communist.",
     "date": 1911,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:studied",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b18",
     "shot": "travels",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But he also developed a goal that mattered more to millions of Vietnamese people",
     "date": 1911,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b19",
     "shot": "travels",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "than any political ideology.",
     "date": 1911,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b20",
     "shot": "travels",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "He wanted Vietnam to be independent.",
     "date": 1911,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b21",
     "shot": "viet_minh",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In 1941, Ho returned to Vietnam and helped establish the Viet Minh,",
     "date": 1941,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b22",
     "shot": "viet_minh",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "a nationalist movement led by communists that fought for Vietnamese independence and resisted Japanese",
     "date": 1941,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:Japanese",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b23",
     "shot": "viet_minh",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "occupation during World War II.",
     "date": 1941,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "birds"
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b24",
     "shot": "surrender45",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Then, in August 1945, Japan surrendered.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:surrendered.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b25",
     "shot": "surrender45",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "For Ho Chi Minh, this was the moment he'd been waiting for.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b26",
     "shot": "ba_dinh",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "On September 2, 1945, he stood before a huge crowd in Hanoi and declared Vietnam independent.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       6,
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "grand"
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b27",
     "shot": "ba_dinh",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And he began his speech with words Americans would immediately recognize.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       6,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b28",
     "shot": "ba_dinh",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "\"All men are created equal.\"",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "sparkle",
       2,
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "grand"
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b29",
     "shot": "ba_dinh",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He was quoting the American Declaration of Independence.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:Declaration",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b30",
     "shot": "echo",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Think about that for a moment.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b31",
     "shot": "echo",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Ho Chi Minh was asking the United States to support a country fighting against foreign domination.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b32",
     "shot": "echo",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "To make his case, he used the words of America's own founding document.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b33",
     "shot": "echo",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "He was essentially telling Washington: You fought for your freedom.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b34",
     "shot": "echo",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Now help us fight for ours.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b35",
     "shot": "oss",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And the United States had reasons to listen.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b36",
     "shot": "oss",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "During World War II, American intelligence agents had cooperated with Ho's forces against Japan.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b37",
     "shot": "oss",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Washington knew who he was, and it knew his movement had helped fight a common enemy.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b38",
     "shot": "red_fear",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But there was one problem.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b39",
     "shot": "red_fear",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Ho Chi Minh was a communist.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:communist.",
       0.7
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b40",
     "shot": "red_fear",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And as World War II ended, America's next great fear was already taking shape.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b41",
     "shot": "red_fear",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The spread of communism.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b42",
     "shot": "choice",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Washington had a choice: support Vietnamese independence, even if it meant working with a",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b43",
     "shot": "choice",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "communist leader, or support its European ally, France.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b44",
     "shot": "choice",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "America chose France.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:France.",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b45",
     "shot": "choice",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And that decision would help set the stage for one of the most devastating",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s02b46",
     "shot": "choice",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "wars of the twentieth century.",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    }
   ],
   "mood": "sombre"
  }
 ]
}